      "problem": "Find a vector equation of the straight line passing through $P(3,-1,7)$ and parallel to ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14073156/assets/48f9afd751f6424fe465e494fd254593de065563231a1f5df07741789969c1af.png)",
